ku Bakti Sun. Kebajikannya sebagai Nabi, keagungannya sebagai raja, kekayaannya meliputi empat samudera, Bio (Kuil) leluhurnya tetap dipuja dan terpeliharalah anak-cucunya."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.17.02","number":2,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"gù","traditional":"故","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dà","traditional":"大","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dé","traditional":"德","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"bì","traditional":"必","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dé","traditional":"得","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wèi","traditional":"位","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"bì","traditional":"必","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dé","traditional":"得","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"禄","pinyin":"lù","traditional":"祿","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"bì","traditional":"必","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dé","traditional":"得","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"míng","traditional":"名","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"bì","traditional":"必","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dé","traditional":"得","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"寿","pinyin":"shòu","traditional":"壽","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"\"Maka seorang yang mempunyai Kebajikan Besar niscaya mendapat kedudukan, mendapat berkah, mendapat nama dan mendapat panjang usia."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.17.03","number":3,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"gù","traditional":"故","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shēng","traditional":"生","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wù","traditional":"物","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bì","traditional":"必","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yīn","traditional":"因","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"cái","traditional":"材","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"笃","pinyin":"dǔ","traditional":"篤","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yān","traditional":"焉","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"gù","traditional":"故","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zāi","traditional":"栽","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhě","traditional":"者","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"péi","traditional":"培","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"倾","pinyin":"qīng","traditional":"傾","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhě","traditional":"者","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"fù","traditional":"覆","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"\"Demikianlah Tuhan YME menjadikan segenap wujud, masing-masing dibantu sesuai dengan sifatnya: Kepada pohon yang bersemi dibantu tumbuh, sementara kepada yang condong dibantu roboh."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.17.04","number":4,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"modern":"诗","pinyin":"shī","traditional":"詩","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yuē","traditional":"曰","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"：‘"},{"pinyin":"jiā","traditional":"嘉","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"乐","pinyin":"lè","traditional":"樂","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jūn","traditional":"君","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"宪","pinyin":"xiàn","traditional":"憲","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"宪","pinyin":"xiàn","traditional":"憲","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"lìng","traditional":"令","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dé","traditional":"德","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"yí","traditional":"宜","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"mín","traditional":"民","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yí","traditional":"宜","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rén","traditional":"人","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"shòu","traditional":"受","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"禄","pinyin":"lù","traditional":"祿","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"于","pinyin":"yú","traditional":"於","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"bǎo","traditional":"保","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yòu","traditional":"佑","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"mìng","traditional":"命","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"zì","traditional":"自","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shēn","traditional":"申","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。’"}]],"translation_indonesian":"\"Di dalam Kitab Sanjak tertulis, 'Betapa mengagumkan dan bahagia seorang Junzi - Kuncu, gemilanglah Kebajikannya yang selaras dengan kehendak rakyat dan selaras dengan Kemanusiaan. Diterimanya karunia Tuhan; terlindung Firman yang dikaruniakan kepadanya. Demikianlah selalu diterimanya dari Tuhan (III.2.5.1)."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.17.05","number":5,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"gù","traditional":"故","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dà","traditional":"大","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dé","traditional":"德","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhě","traditional":"者","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bì","traditional":"必","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shòu","traditional":"受","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"mìng","traditional":"命","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。”"}]],"translation_indonesian":"\"Maka seorang yang ber-Kebajikan Besar itu niscaya menerima Firman.\" TENGAH SEMPURNA BAB XVII (Yang Berpenerus)"}],"source_file":"02 - Zhong Yong 中庸/17 - Bab XVI - Laku Bakti Yang Besar.md","title":"Bab XVI — Laku Bakti Yang Besar"}
